  "title": "Old Fashioned Pound Cake II",
  "description": "This classic pound cake, flavored with vanilla and lemon extracts, has no leavening powder-just the air you beat into it!",
  "authors": [
    "Sylvia Zumpano"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:06:20-04:00",
